cff-version: 1.2.0
title: 'CCEM: Cosmic Cuddles Euclid Mocks'
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the following paper: Ruhberg, L. E., et al. (2026, in prep).
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Laslo Erik
    family-names: Ruhberg
    orcid: 'https://orcid.org/0009-0003-3810-1245'
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: ''
  - type: url
    value: ''
repository-code: >-
  https://github.com/Lasloruhberg/Cosmic-Cuddles-Euclid-Mocks
abstract: >-
  This repository allows to utilise the IllustrisTNG
  Visualisation API to generate realistic Euclid mock images
  by mocking Euclid wide survey observations that include
  photon noise, drizzling, read-out-noise, and MACC
  sampling, based on Q1 values. Real background are then
  superimposed.
